cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the derived indices, please cite the accompanying publication."
title: "Gut health and dysbiosis indices for chickens: analysis code"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-11-08
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a meta-analysis of gut health biomarkers and 16S rRNA gene
  sequencing data from chicken experiments. Builds a seven-domain gut health
  index from published biomarkers and tests whether community composition can
  predict it as a gut dysbiosis index.
